mial.py:transform -> sklearn/base.py:_validate_data -> sklearn/base.py:_check_feature_names -> [outside target package omitted]`\n- path: `sklearn/utils/_set_output.py:wrapped -> sklearn/base.py:fit_transform -> sklearn/preprocessing/_polynomial.py:fit -> sklearn/preprocessing/_polynomial.py:_get_base_knot_positions -> [outside target package omitted]`\n- path: `sklearn/utils/validation.py:check_array -> sklearn/base.py:_validate_data -> sklearn/preprocessing/_polynomial.py:transform -> [outside target package omitted]`\n- Additional condensed paths omitted: `5`\n\n## Anchor Artifacts"}, {"content": "To address the feature request for adding sparse matrix output to `SplineTransformer`, let's start by exploring the repository structure and identifying the core files related to the `SplineTransformer` and preprocessing utilities.\n\nFirst, let's look at the `SplineTransformer` class in the `sklearn.preprocessing` module.\n\n<function=get_entity_contents>\n<parameter=entity_names>['sklearn/preprocessing/_spline.py:SplineTransformer']</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "get_entity_contents", "content": "OBSERVATION:\n##Searching for entity `sklearn/preprocessing/_spline.py:SplineTransformer`...\n### Search Result:\nInvalid name. \nHint: Valid entity name should be formatted as \"file_path:QualifiedName\" or just \"file_path\".\n"}, {"content": "It seems there was a mistake in the entity name format. Let's try again with the correct format.\n\n<function=get_entity_contents>\n<parameter=entity_names>['sklearn/preprocessing/_spline.py:SplineTransformer']</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "get_entity_contents", "content": "OBSERVATION:\n##Searching for entity `sklearn/preprocessing/_spline.py:SplineTransformer`...\n### Search Result:\nInvalid name. \nHint: Valid entity name shou